      "content": "i checked the routines and there isnt anything scheduled for those times. and the logs just show \"user override\" or \"system adjustment\" but dont say who or what triggered it. it just feels like someone knows exactly when i'm settling in for the night. my ex was really tech savvy and he always knew how to get under my skin... i'm starting to think he might have kept remote access or something. if i were to try and track the timing of these changes, what kind of data should i be looking for to see if it matches his old habits?",
